{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first collab DLC for Hero\u2019s Adventure, it brings in three fan-favorite heroes from Wandering Sword, Shangguan Hong, Sima Ling, and Yuwen Yi. Building on each character\u2019s original martial art techniques and signature moves, the DLC expands both games\u2019 campaign, adds new side quests and four pivotal characters, seamlessly integrates the map White Mou Marsh and Sects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narratively, the DLC picks up right after your victory at the Heroes\u2019 Meeting. Together with your new allies, you\u2019ll investigate a baffling murder, unearthing long-buried secrets that spark a deeper debate about chivalry, righteousness, and moral ambiguity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731090?t=1749190154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731090?t=1749190154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731090/074c0d02fe3057d584e84c54c01f4c2702274ac5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749190154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731090/074c0d02fe3057d584e84c54c01f4c2702274ac5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749190154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first collab DLC for Hero\u2019s Adventure, it brings in three fan-favorite heroes from Wandering Sword, Shangguan Hong, Sima Ling, and Yuwen Yi. Building on each character\u2019s original martial art techniques and signature moves, the DLC expan